      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this would be cool, but only if it is *not* the default option and can be chosen. There are a lot of worlds with physical buttons these days and I find them incredibly inconvenient. Sure, they are cool for immersion, but I'm in a virtual world where I don't need to worry about the size of my hands pushing buttons. Why would I want physical buttons?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
